{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫《萬千星輝賀台慶》將於19日舉行，多位美女藝人組成「炫舞女王」正密鑼緊鼓排舞，包括陳煒、傅嘉莉、姚子羚、陳敏之、關嘉敏、黃靖靈（波波）等昨晚便在電視城排練，陳煒、傅嘉莉、姚子羚、陳敏之邊跳邊除衫及將外套拋走，不過敏之就不夠力水，拋中身旁</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T04:52:29.476839+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:47:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T04:45:50.263609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T04:45:50.263609+00:00","content_hash":"440ba27ef6196180a8b4fe75fcd248573df408ad3e73ee9d4a281c693675f725","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}